# Input

```svelte
{#each boxes as box}
{const area=box.width*box.height}
{const label = (value) =>
    `${value} square pixels`}
<p>{label(area)}</p>
{/each}

{#if user}
{let name=$state(user.name)}
{let greeting=$derived(`Hello ${name}`)}
<input bind:value={name} />
<p>{greeting}</p>
{/if}

<Component>
{let value=getValue()}
{let one=1, two=2}
</Component>

{#if foo}
    { const bar = await 1 }
    <div>
        {const bar = 'shadowing'}
        {bar}
    </div>
    {bar}
{/if}

```


